{"id":"53c31cee4a64d821","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-signature.md","title":"df-signature","display":"df-signature","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":[],"label":"56-df-signature","aliases":["56-df-signature"],"display":"df-signature","type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-signature"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-signature</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-signature"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-signature\"><code>df-signature</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 为非空函数符号集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为元数函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma&#39;\">\\(\\Sigma&#39;\\)</span> 为任意集合参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\coloneqq(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma\\coloneqq(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sig}(\\Sigma&#39;)\\iff\n\\exists F\\,\\exists a\\;(\\Sigma&#39;=(F,a)\\land F\\ne\\varnothing\\land a:F\\to\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sig}(\\Sigma&#39;)\\iff\n\\exists F\\,\\exists a\\;(\\Sigma&#39;=(F,a)\\land F\\ne\\varnothing\\land a:F\\to\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathcal F\\mid\\operatorname{ar}(f)=n\\}\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathcal F\\mid\\operatorname{ar}(f)=n\\}\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>零元函数符号就是常元。本文件固定非空签名约定；函数符号尚不带任何代数解释。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，§2.1.1，印刷第25页，OCR页块46。本次据用户提供的本地 DjVu 文字层核对陈述；OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-signature","text":"`df-signature`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma'","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma\\coloneqq(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sig}(\\Sigma')\\iff\n\\exists F\\,\\exists a\\;(\\Sigma'=(F,a)\\land F\\ne\\varnothing\\land a:F\\to\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathcal F\\mid\\operatorname{ar}(f)=n\\}\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true}],"bytes":993,"backlinks":[{"id":"ef3a31528875d9d3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d8a892f85575c609","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S^{<\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}S^n$，包括空序列；$|w|$ 为有限序列 $w$ 的长度。无排序签名的记号 $\\operatorname{Sig}$ 见 [[56-df-signature]]。"},{"id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$ 为 [[56-df-signature]] 的签名，$\\mathcal V$ 与 $T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 如 [[56-df-terms]]。"},{"id":"904f367f2b11cda0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$ 为 [[56-df-signature]] 的签名；$G$ 为集合参数。"},{"id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$ 为 [[56-df-signature]] 的签名，$\\mathcal V$ 为 [[56-df-variable]] 的变量集。"},{"id":"bd57a306fd3547e4","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F,A,B,C,D$ 为两两不同的函数符号，$\\Sigma$ 的函数符号集为 $\\{F,A,B,C,D\\}$，$\\mathrm{ar}(F)=2$，其余四个符号的元数为0，见 [[56-df-signature]]。"},{"id":"ec93c08d698f2539","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F,C$ 为互异符号，$\\Sigma=(\\{F,C\\},\\{(F,2),(C,0)\\})$ 是 [[56-df-signature]] 的签名。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-signature.md]]"}],"outgoing":[]}